 dystopian scene in an abandoned amusement park at night. focus on the 
Massive scary decaying statues and animatronic figures of oversized 
scary cartoon characters with cracked faces and large expressive eyes. 
long sharp teeth. Rusted rides, overgrown weeds, flickering lights, and 
fog drifting between broken roller coasters. Cinematic lighting, 
ultra-detailed, realistic textures, eerie mood, dark atmosphere, 8k. 
creepy abandoned animatronics. These Disney\-like animatronics were left
 to rot and decay after their parks were abandoned or their attractions 
were never realized. So today we’re giving them the coverage they 
